Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
Apka pyara nawasa karbala me lutgaya<br>
<br>
Kya bhula baithi thi ummat aayaye tatheer ko<br>
mezbaa'n bankar bulaaya mehmaa'n shabbir ko<br>
Kyu musalmaa'n hoke phir mehmaan ko dhoka diya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
Raahe haq me goud ke paalo piya ghar dediya<br>
bayyate fasiq na ki haq ke liye sar dediya<br>
sar magar islam ka shabbir ne uncha kiya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
Ahle haq batil ki taqat se kabhi darte nahi<br>
jiska maslik ho shahadat wo kabhi marte nahi<br>
hum hussaini waale hai duniya hame samjhi hai kya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
role tu bhi uske gham me aye dile qasta jigar<br>
jinke gham me roraha hai aaj tak jin o bashar<br>
wo hasan ki jaan aur zehra ka dilbar lutgaya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
Karbala me sar kataaya fatima ke laal ne<br>
aasiyou ko baqshwaaya fatima ke laal ne<br>
waqte aaqir zeere khanjar shukr ka sajda kiya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
wo khuda ki zaat par jo khoum me de ye yaqeen<br>
kasrate aatish hargis khouf khasakte nahi<br>
aaj bhi leti hai duniya imtehaa to kya kiya<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
<br>
Isko kehte hai saqawat sabr iska naam hai<br>
haq parasto ke liye istar se ek paighamm hai<br>
kar sada nalou se ruswa ye sabaq humko mila<br>
<br>
Ya rasool Allah Ya Habeeb Allah<br>
